	void Init(float Radius, float MaxSpeed, const FLinearColor& Color);

	/** Switches the look to these layers; nothing happens when they did not change. */
	void SetLayers(const FJamLayers& InLayers);

	/** The fighter lost health at Time: the body goes white for a moment. */
